      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉她如果彻底释放所有的激情，\n或许能够超越现在的极限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173e285645b2cc3fc95569247faf815285f18ec893de90a8bec40e0c2439d57b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
