      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，我不知道八重无敌本人\n是否能控制得了那股激情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d070c0691d21ee03fa08175de50b80252067ed0cadf24e2f2174a8ce8fe506",
